      "content": "# Security

`dsh-wsl-expose` must not log, print, or return secrets (tokens, passwords, PEM keys).

Port exposure to the LAN is opt-in (`allowApply`). Prefer `plan` over `apply`.

Report issues via GitHub Issues on this repository.
